title Home Assistant: multitasking (X-Background=freeze): hidden, keys typed meanwhile dropped, shown again with a full repaint, closed by the launcher
sizes 640x480 800x480
lifecycle
env HA_DEMO home

wait 1600
hide
expect hidden
stale down
stale enter
show
expect visible
wait 400
expect repaint
expect text "Favourites"
expect text "On, 72 %"
close
expect quit
